          "Most abundant photosynthetic organism on Earth?",
          "Prochlorococcus (cyanobacterium)"
        ],
        [
          "Most abundant animal on Earth?",
          "Copepods (marine zooplankton)"
        ],
        [
          "Largest animal on Earth?",
          "Blue whale (*Balaenoptera musculus*): 29.9 m, ~173 tonnes"
        ],
        [
          "What fixes nitrogen in oligotrophic tropical ocean?",
          "Trichodesmium (cyanobacterium)"
        ],
        [
          "How do corals get most of their energy?",
          "Symbiodinium (zooxanthellae) in their tissue"
        ],
        [
          "What makes jellyfish harmful vs useful?",
          "Nematocyst venom useful for prey; blooms disrupt fisheries/power plants"
        ],
        [
          "Fastest-swimming fish?",
          "Black marlin: ~36 m/s (130 km/h)"
        ],
        [
